        68.33861541748047,
        526.5850830078125,
        78.84261322021484
      ],
      "text": "Use of linezolid for at least 6 months was shown to increase effectiveness, although toxicity may limit use. The analysis suggested that  d",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        79.33861541748047,
        526.5982666015625,
        89.84261322021484
      ],
      "text": "using linezolid for the entire duration of treatment would optimize its effect (about 70% of patients on linezolid with data received it for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        90.33861541748047,
        526.6161499023438,
        100.84261322021484
      ],
      "text": ">6 months and 30% for 18 months or the entire duration). No patient predictors for early cessation of linezolid could be inferred from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.33861541748047,
        138.62611389160156,
        111.84261322021484
      ],
      "text": "the IPD subanalysis.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.17333221435547,
        526.618896484375,
        125.67733001708984
      ],
      "text": "Evidence on the safety and effectiveness of delamanid beyond 6 months was insufficient for review. The use of delamanid beyond these  e",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        125.24533081054688,
        526.58740234375,
        136.6773223876953
      ],
      "text": "(79) limits should follow best practices in “off-label” use  . As a result of multiple reviews as new data have gradually become available, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        137.17332458496094,
        291.488525390625,
        147.6773223876953
      ],
      "text": "use of delamanid is no longer restricted by the age of the patient.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        151.00791931152344,
        376.09613037109375,
        161.5119171142578
      ],
      "text": "Pyrazinamide is counted as an effective agent only when DST results confirm susceptibility.  f",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        164.84263610839844,
        526.5691528320312,
        175.3466339111328
      ],
      "text": "Every dose of imipenem–cilastatin and meropenem is administered with clavulanic acid, which is available only in formulations combined  g",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        175.84263610839844,
        524.3807983398438,
        186.3466339111328
      ],
      "text": "with amoxicillin. Amoxicillin–clavulanic acid is not counted as an additional effective TB agent and should not be used without imipenem–",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.84263610839844,
        155.85890197753906,
        197.3466339111328
      ],
      "text": "cilastatin or meropenem.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        200.67723083496094,
        526.6246948242188,
        211.1812286376953
      ],
      "text": "Amikacin and streptomycin are to be considered only if DST results confirm susceptibility, and if high-quality audiometry monitoring for  h",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        211.67723083496094,
        526.7666625976562,
        222.1812286376953
      ],
      "text": "hearing loss can be ensured. Streptomycin is to be considered only if amikacin cannot be used (i.e. if it is unavailable or there is documented",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.983232498168945,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        222.67723083496094,
        526.5767822265625,
        233.1812286376953
      ],
      "text": "resistance) and if DST results confirm susceptibility (i.e. resistance to streptomycin is not detectable with second-line molecular LPAs and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.67723083496094,
        461.8453369140625,
        244.1812286376953
      ],
      "text": "phenotypic DST is required). Kanamycin and capreomycin are no longer recommended for use in MDR-TB regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.5118865966797,
        526.7882690429688,
        258.0158996582031
      ],
